* ADA4177 inverting amplifier, gain = -10 V/V
VCC VPLUS 0 15
VEE VMINUS 0 -15
VIN IN 0 SINE(0 50m 1k) AC 1

RIN IN NINV 10k
RFB OUT NINV 100k

XU1 0 NINV VPLUS VMINUS OUT ADA4177

* Simplified ADA4177 macromodel: 1e6 DC gain, 3.5 MHz GBW
.subckt ADA4177 INP INM VPLUS VMINUS OUT
GDOM 0 NINT INP INM 1m
RDOM NINT 0 1G
CDOM NINT 0 45.473p
EBUF OUT 0 NINT 0 1
.ends ADA4177

.tran 0 5m 0 1u
.ac dec 100 10 10Meg
.meas AC gain_db FIND 20*log10(mag(V(OUT)/V(IN))) AT=1k

.end
